# Replace IDs/tokens and update billingVersion from GET after every different command.
# Keep the same requestId/payload when retrying one command; {{$uuid}} creates a fresh ID on each send.
# Receipt/refund commands record externally verified money; they do not initiate transfers.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@ownerToken = replace-with-owner-token
@tenantToken = replace-with-tenant-token
@organizationId = replace-organization-uuid
@propertyId = replace-property-uuid
@leaseId = replace-lease-uuid
@invoiceId = replace-invoice-uuid
@paymentId = replace-payment-uuid
@claimId = replace-claim-uuid
@allocationId = replace-allocation-uuid
@settlementId = replace-settlement-uuid
@leaseVersion = 3
@billingVersion = 0
@ownerPassword = replace-locally-do-not-commit
@receivedOn = 2026-10-15
@manager = {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/billing
@tenant = {{host}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/billing

### Preview calendar rent before selecting the policy
GET {{manager}}/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Open once for an executed lease (lease version, not billing version)
POST {{manager}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","leaseVersion":{{leaseVersion}},"policy":"CALENDAR_ACTUAL_DAYS"}

### Refresh current account version and balances
GET {{manager}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Tenant invoices including future rent; paginate all histories
GET {{tenant}}/invoices?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant reports a bank transfer; no funds are created
POST {{tenant}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"amount":"25000.00","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","reference":"BANK-RECEIPT-0001","receivedOn":"{{receivedOn}}","reason":"Rent transfer for independent verification."}

### Owner reads payment reports and copies a claim ID
GET {{manager}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Owner independently verifies statement, then confirms with password
POST {{manager}}/claims/{{claimId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"password":"{{ownerPassword}}","reason":"Matched the transfer to the owner's bank statement."}

### Alternative: reject an unmatched report
POST {{manager}}/claims/{{claimId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"password":"{{ownerPassword}}","reason":"This reference and amount could not be verified."}

### Alternative: record independently checked external receipt directly
POST {{manager}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"amount":"50000.00","channel":"MOBILE_MONEY","reference":"EXTERNAL-DEPOSIT-0002","receivedOn":"{{receivedOn}}","password":"{{ownerPassword}}","reason":"Deposit matched to the external collection statement."}

### Copy a verified payment ID; available funds start unallocated
GET {{manager}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Allocate to a rent or deposit invoice from this same lease
POST {{manager}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/allocations
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"invoiceId":"{{invoiceId}}","amount":"25000.00"}

### Tenant's receipt evidence and allocation/refund history
GET {{tenant}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Download private UTF-8 receipt
GET {{tenant}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/receipt/document
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Read allocations before a correction
GET {{manager}}/allocations
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Reverse an incorrect allocation; retain original evidence
POST {{manager}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"reason":"Receipt was allocated to the wrong invoice."}

### Void only unused/unrefunded receipts; this is not a refund
POST {{manager}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"password":"{{ownerPassword}}","reason":"Incorrect external receipt entry, independently investigated."}

### Record an ACTUAL completed refund of unallocated money
POST {{manager}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"amount":"1000.00","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","reference":"EXTERNAL-REFUND-0003","receivedOn":"{{receivedOn}}","password":"{{ownerPassword}}","reason":"Unallocated overpayment returned and verified externally."}

### Inspection or other agreed charge before finalization
POST {{manager}}/charges
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"amount":"1500.00","dueDate":"{{receivedOn}}","reason":"Documented inspection charge supplied by the business."}

### Credit an unpaid rent/charge amount; reverse paid allocations first
POST {{manager}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"amount":"500.00","reason":"Agreed correction to the outstanding charge."}

### After lease /complete: apply end-date credits and freeze deposit collection
POST {{manager}}/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"reason":"Move-out charges reviewed; finalize rent through the agreed end."}

### Propose explained deposit deductions after inspection/finalization
POST {{manager}}/deposit/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"deduction":"5000.00","reason":"Inspection: damaged fitting replacement 3000; agreed cleaning 2000."}

### Tenant reads held amount, proposed deduction, and refund due
GET {{tenant}}/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant explicitly ACCEPTs or DISPUTEs the current proposal
POST {{tenant}}/deposit/proposals/{{settlementId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"decision":"ACCEPT","reason":"I reviewed the inspection explanation and accept this reconciliation."}

### Owner may withdraw a PENDING proposal only
POST {{manager}}/deposit/proposals/{{settlementId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"reason":"Withdrawn pending proposal for correction and fresh review."}

### After acceptance and ACTUAL transfer, record deposit refund
POST {{manager}}/deposit/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{billingVersion}},"amount":"45000.00","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","reference":"DEPOSIT-REFUND-0004","receivedOn":"{{receivedOn}}","password":"{{ownerPassword}}","reason":"Accepted refundable deposit transferred and independently checked."}

### Immutable financial activity
GET {{tenant}}/history?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Recorded refunds
GET {{tenant}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant dashboard: one row per currency
GET {{host}}/api/v1/me/leases/billing-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Property dashboard: current authorized management, one row per currency
GET {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/billing-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

# Check account.checkoutReady before /leases/{id}/release-unit.
# That existing endpoint also needs the CURRENT LEASE version and vacancy confirmation.
